gfm-0.29-gfm-extensions.json
  The examples of the extension sections (Tables, Task list items,
  Strikethrough, Autolinks) of the GitHub Flavored Markdown Spec, version
  0.29-gfm (2019-04-06), which is based on the CommonMark Spec by John
  MacFarlane. Licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0,
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
  Source: https://github.github.com/gfm/
  Fetched: 2026-11-03. Transcribed from the spec's HTML into the layout of
  spec.json (fields example, section, markdown, html): the "→" tab marks
  became tabs, visible-space spans became spaces, HTML entities were decoded.
  Example 657 (Disallowed Raw HTML) is left out: that extension is not
  implemented, because nothing here renders HTML for a browser.
